  "prefLabel": "Agr 1002.03 Seal of Quality Use",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1002.03 Seal of Quality Use.\n\n(a) A person holding a current seal of quality permit may use the seal of quality design on containers, labels, signs, advertising, or other informational or promotional material.\n\n(b) It shall be prohibited to use the seal of quality design, or infer an active seal of quality permit, on or for the sale or presentation of any container, label, sign, advertising, or other information or promotional material without an active yearly seal of quality permit.\n\nSource. #2123, eff 8-20-82; ss by #2824, eff 8-20-84, EXPIRED 8-20-90\n\nNew. #5196, eff 7-31-91, EXPIRED 7-31-97\n\nNew. #6734, eff 4-21-98 (formerly Agr 1001.03), EXPIRED: 4-21-06\n\nNew. #10952, eff 10-21-15; ss by #14554, eff 4-7-26, EXPIRES: 4-7-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr1000.html"
